  - You've made it to the edge of Crystal Forest! Good job!
  - But your journey is far from over.
  - The next area - Sky Ruins - is still drained of light and it is your task to
    restore it.
  - Additionally, Eclipse must be completely stopped in order to save the realm.
  - To do this, you must have enough crystals.
  - Make sure to have this before stepping through the portal...
